Gepards are successful anti-aircraft weapons which
proved themselves in the war against the Forces of
Darkness. The Gepard is made of a Leopard tank
chassis onto which two 35mm cannons are added.
These are capable of destroying low flying objects at
short and middle range. This modern weapon can be
also used for defensive tasks. It is capable of
destroying ground targets, especially armoured ones.
It is devastatingly accurate when shooting at slower
armoured objects.~
